# The bundled skill body ships inside the wheel byte-for-byte; pin LF so a
# CRLF checkout (Windows autocrlf) cannot desync the wheel from load_body().
citefinder/prompts/*.md text eol=lf
# The plan index is generated from plan frontmatter, so two branches that each
# added or closed a plan both rewrite it. `union` keeps both sides on a local
# merge — a duplicated row that `planners index .` repairs, rather than a
# conflict in a file nobody hand-edits. Written by `planners install`.
.planners/README.md merge=union
